WEBVTT

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:30.584
Gray car, saggy roof,

00:10:30.584 --> 00:10:33.379
the Knight Rider lights
in the front -- I love that car.

00:10:34.171 --> 00:10:35.464
But it was hard.

00:10:36.924 --> 00:10:40.886
So what if, instead of debt,
we invested in people,

00:10:40.928 --> 00:10:43.138
the way we invest in start-ups?

00:10:44.807 --> 00:10:48.060
As a creator, you should be able
to use technology

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:51.146
to raise money to finance your ambitions.

00:10:52.314 --> 00:10:53.857
If you so choose,

00:10:53.899 --> 00:10:57.361
you should be able to sell
equity in your future.

00:10:57.986 --> 00:11:00.614
And you should be able to set the terms.